	(text "VDDA 2.2 uF per ball to VSSA. VREFHIA-D: 22 uF each to VREFLO (16-bit mode).\nVDAC (ADCINB0, V2) = CMPSS DAC reference: >= 1 uF at the ball (table 6-1).\nAll on VREF2V5: 4 x 22 + 1 + 1 uF = 90 uF, 99 uF at +10 %: inside the REF5025E\n1-100 uF range (summed from the design on every build)."
